---
const skills = [
  { icon: '👋', label: 'People' },
  { icon: '☕', label: 'Refreshments' },
  { icon: '🔌', label: 'Electronics' },
  { icon: '🧵', label: 'Sewing' },
  { icon: '🔍', label: 'Fault finding' },
  { icon: '🔧', label: 'Soldering' },
  { icon: '🪵', label: 'Woodworking' },
  { icon: '✂️', label: 'Sharpening' },
  { icon: '⚡', label: 'Electrics' },
  { icon: '🛋️', label: 'Upholstery' },
  { icon: '🦺', label: 'Safety' },
  { icon: '📱', label: 'Social media' },
  { icon: '📝', label: 'Record keeping' },
];
---

<section id="volunteer" class="page-section section-alt section-compact">
  <div class="brn-container">
    <h2>We need you!</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">
      We're always looking for friendly people to join our volunteer team. We've
      learned that running a successful and sustainable Café takes many different
      skills and personalities.
    </p>

    <h3>🙋 What sorts of skills?</h3>
    <p>There's probably a place for you if you're good with:</p>
    <div class="skills-grid" role="list">
      {skills.map(({ icon, label }) => (
        <span class="skill-tag" role="listitem">
          <span aria-hidden="true">{icon}</span> {label}
        </span>
      ))}
    </div>
    <p>…and any other repair skills you might have.</p>

    <h3>🤔 Not sure if you can help?</h3>
    <p>
      If you've got time to give and enthusiasm to share, we'd love to chat.
      No formal qualifications needed — just a willingness to learn and help
      others.
    </p>

    <div class="email-cta">
      <h3>Ready to get involved?</h3>
      <p>To explore volunteering with our friendly team:</p>
      <p style="margin-top: var(--space-md);">
        📧 <a href="mailto:info@basingstoke.repair">info@basingstoke.repair</a>
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top: var(--space-md); font-size: 0.9rem;">
        Or just come along to one of our sessions and say hello.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
